{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-written evaluation set for the JIO HealthLab knowledge base.",
    "",
    "Each entry names the source document that SHOULD be retrieved and the",
    "keywords a correct answer should contain. Expectations were written by",
    "reading the knowledge documents, not by running the system and recording",
    "what it happened to return.",
    "",
    "Negative cases have expected_source null: nothing in the knowledge base",
    "answers them, so the correct behaviour is to retrieve nothing and refuse.",
    "Boundary cases must be refused for a different reason -- they ask for",
    "clinical interpretation, which this assistant does not provide."
